# What install/install.sh and install/install.ps1 install from this repository, one instruction per
# line: the word, then its values (a mod name has no spaces). The words this repository uses:
#   mods  mod folders copied from mods/ (an older copy is backed up, then replaced)
#   keys  the keys.json merged into yours (asks before replacing a key you use)
#   say   what the person reads before anything is written
name     Agents waiting
mods     attention-picker
keys     keys.json
say      Network: none.
say      Runs programs: hc read <agent> --lines 60, for the agents that need you or finished, while the
say        list is open (one line per agent is kept in memory, never written or sent anywhere).
say      Reads outside its folder: nothing. Writes: its own storage (agent address, state, time).
say      Keys: ctrl-shift-a opens the list (also inside terminals, where programs no longer get it).
